1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:02,160
Is there one night you can't stop thinking

2
00:00:02,220 --> 00:00:02,520
about?

3
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:06,220
The night Jesus was arrested, His friend Peter

4
00:00:06,280 --> 00:00:07,241
stood by a fire.

5
00:00:08,201 --> 00:00:10,181
People asked if he was one of His followers.

6
00:00:11,681 --> 00:00:12,241
I am not.

7
00:00:13,361 --> 00:00:14,761
Three times, he said no.

8
00:00:15,781 --> 00:00:16,521
Jesus died.

9
00:00:17,081 --> 00:00:18,121
He rose from the dead.

10
00:00:19,041 --> 00:00:20,261
Peter went back to fishing.

11
00:00:21,282 --> 00:00:22,862
All night, nothing.

12
00:00:23,882 --> 00:00:26,102
At sunrise, Jesus stands on the shore.

13
00:00:26,802 --> 00:00:28,302
He tells them where to throw the net.

14
00:00:29,062 --> 00:00:30,282
It fills with fish.

15
00:00:31,162 --> 00:00:34,823
A friend cries, "It is the Lord." Peter jumps

16
00:00:34,863 --> 00:00:35,923
into the sea to reach Him.

17
00:00:36,863 --> 00:00:40,903
On the beach: "a fire of coals." In the King

18
00:00:40,923 --> 00:00:43,643
James Bible, these words appear only twice.

19
00:00:44,683 --> 00:00:47,043
Here, and the night Peter said no.

20
00:00:48,024 --> 00:00:48,764
Come and dine.

21
00:00:49,324 --> 00:00:49,844
Come and eat.

22
00:00:50,884 --> 00:00:52,604
Jesus hands them bread and fish.

23
00:00:53,384 --> 00:00:56,004
After the meal, He asks Peter three times:

24
00:00:57,064 --> 00:00:58,024
Lovest thou me?

25
00:00:58,624 --> 00:00:59,404
Do you love me?

26
00:01:00,384 --> 00:01:02,265
The third time, Peter is sad.

27
00:01:03,305 --> 00:01:06,445
Lord, thou knowest all things; thou knowest

28
00:01:06,625 --> 00:01:07,445
that I love thee.

29
00:01:07,985 --> 00:01:08,785
You know everything.

30
00:01:09,765 --> 00:01:10,665
You know I love you.

31
00:01:11,625 --> 00:01:12,705
Feed my sheep.

32
00:01:13,345 --> 00:01:14,345
Take care of my people.

33
00:01:15,325 --> 00:01:16,986
Three times, no, that night.

34
00:01:17,386 --> 00:01:19,446
Three times, yes, at the second fire.

35
00:01:20,426 --> 00:01:22,706
And before Jesus asked Peter to feed anyone,

36
00:01:23,726 --> 00:01:24,686
Jesus fed Peter.
